Examples::

.. tab:: Freeform

   .. code-block:: dakota

       method
         sampling
           sample_type lhs
           samples = 10
           fixed_seed

.. tab:: JSON

   .. code-block:: json

       {
         "method": [
           {
             "sampling": {
               "sample_type": {"lhs": true},
               "samples": 10,
               "fixed_seed": true
             }
           }
         ]
       }


